### Get Account preferences

GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{accessTokenA}}

### Update Account theme

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/auth/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{accessTokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "appearance": {
        "theme": "dark"
    }
}

### Attempt unsupported theme

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/auth/preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{accessTokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "appearance": {
        "theme": "blue"
    }
}

### Get Account presence

GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/presence
Authorization: Bearer {{accessTokenA}}

### Set Account A presence to busy

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/auth/presence
Authorization: Bearer {{accessTokenA}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status": "busy"
}